// Rift Shard currency - PER-PLAYER wallet (CharacterStats.RiftShards, see CharacterStats.qtn),
// not a shared Frame.Global total. A pickup credits every connected player the same base amount,
// scaled first by the run-wide Global.RiftShardGainBonus (RunMutations.qtn - Greed/Blood Tithe) and
// then by each player's own CharacterStats.RiftShardGainMultiplier (see
// RiftShardUtility.Grant/GrantAll, CurrencyOrbSystem) - each player then spends their own balance
// independently (see docs/breathing-poi.md).
//
// This block used to also hold EnemyHealthBonusMultiplier - Greed's own difficulty-scaling side
// effect, which never really belonged to the currency. Every run-wide encounter modifier now lives
// together in RunMutations.qtn instead (as EnemyMaxHealthBonus, read via
// EncounterModifierUtility), leaving this file with nothing global of its own.
